+++# Executive Summary: Monorepo Hygiene Remediation (Phase Two)
+++
+++**To:** DevOps Lead & Release Engineering Team  
+++**From:** Phase Two Remediator  
+++**Date:** October 2026  
+++**Repository:** `/home/nova/projects/cantina`  
