++++- **Local Cleanup:** Use `./scripts/clean-local.sh --dry-run` or `./scripts/clean-local.sh --confirm` to safely clear transient caches.
++++- **Pre-commit Hooks:** Install pre-commit hooks via `pre-commit install`.
++++
++++---
